<h1>404: this loadout slot is empty</h1>
<p>That page doesn't exist. Try the <a href={b+'/'}>game-dev directory</a>, <a href={b+'/browse/'}>browse by engine and stage</a>, or the <a href={b+'/players/'}>players tab</a>.</p></Base>
